# Copy to .env.local and fill in. .env.local is git-ignored.
# Make an API key at https://open.higgsfield.ai. Format: key-id:key-secret
HF_CREDENTIALS=

# Alternatively use the server-only Vercel environment variable names:
HIGGSFIELD_API_KEY=
HIGGSFIELD_API_SECRET=
# HIGGSFIELD_API_KEY can also contain the combined key-id:key-secret.
# HF_CREDENTIALS takes precedence when both formats are configured.
